# Omarchy Dark: KDE colour scheme for Dolphin, Kate, and Gwenview.
# Near-black greys for the OLED, subtle alternating rows (#101010 / #181818), and the
# title-bar blue #005FB8 for selection. Tracked in
# ~/omarchy-setup/setup/windows-style/colors/.

